irical confirmation of existence of interrelation of a number of biophysical characteristics of living tissue depending on its functional condition and a stage of process of rehabilitation, existence of possible pathological deviations in the studied tissues and prediction of changes of their state is made. Results of researches confirm the made assumptions of adequacy of the developed complex and of its high practical performance. On the basis of the received conclusions the directions for further scientific research are offered. © 2018 Electromagnetics Academy. All rights reserved.	2017-01-01	t	0.3333333333333333
