des monitoring. Besides, the system allows to measure other physical processes parameters, for example, for monitoring and diagnosis-making purposes it has been provided to measure and apply pressure in decreasing spaces (an indicator diagram), gas temperature, a rod position, leakage through stuffing boxes and others.	2014-01-01	t	\N
