arch efficiency is constructed. Minimum (L min = 33.75), maximum (L max = 101.25) and threshold values of diagnostic assessment and their indicators are presented. This model is a basis for the test software which can be used further in practice. © 2018 Institute of Physics Publishing. All rights reserved.	2018-01-01	t	0.5
